# ReportServer .http — exercise every endpoint.
#
# The port must match the server's --port flag / launchSettings.json (default 5173).
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5173

### Health check — GET /ping
GET {{baseUrl}}/ping

### Get the raw improvement report — GET /api/report
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/report

### Dismiss a finding by id — POST /api/dismissals
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/dismissals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "f-001",
  "dismissed_reason": "not applicable"
}

### Dismiss the same finding again — idempotent, returns the original decided_at
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/dismissals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "f-001"
}

### Error path — dismiss a non-existent finding id (expect 404 Problem Details)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/dismissals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "does-not-exist"
}

### Error path — dismiss with a missing id field (expect 400 validation Problem Details)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/dismissals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dismissed_reason": "no id supplied"
}

### Ship (compress and persist) the assembled prompt — POST /api/ship-prompt
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ship-prompt
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "## Heading\n\n**Bold** text with `code`.\n\n---\n\nBody paragraph.",
  "queued_ids": [
    "f-001",
    "f-002"
  ]
}

### Error path — ship with missing prompt field (expect 400 validation Problem Details)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ship-prompt
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "queued_ids": []
}

### Gracefully shut down the server — GET /shutdown
GET {{baseUrl}}/shutdown
